A good candidate for an eleven conduct ascension down the tubes!

Started an orcish wizard with a ring of slow digestion and a +5 (!!!)
ring of increase damage and managed to find two polymorph traps in the
gnomish mines.  I found a ring valued at 300 Zm earlier on but didn't
know if it was polymorph or polymorph control before turn 15,000.
With nothing left to lose I put on the ring and jumped on the trap ...
voila! "You feel like a new orc!"  It was polymorph control! With the
other trap I acquired a yellow dragon (baby at first) and a vampire
(soon to be lord) and then found 2 more poly traps in the mines and 3
more traps in the quest levels.  Did a bunch of pudding farming and
then revisited the gnomish poly traps and then explored the main
dungeon down almost to medusa.  Once weak from hunger yet again I Eye-
ported back to the Quest and as I was walking to the poly trap I
stepped onto a sleep trap and while helpless a vampire bat turned
minotaur (or a chameleon, I suppose) whalloped me!  Doh!

With all of those polytraps (and 2 polymorph potions as it turns out)
I could have farmed for a hypothetical 136,000 turns (give or take
maybe 30,000 depending on ring wear, being stressed, etc.)


